# Head Office Monorepo

The central control center for the Head Office platform, client projects, and autonomous agent orchestration.

## Repository Map

### 1. Applications & Tools
- [head-office-app/](head-office-app/) — Primary product surface (PRD `/` + Publisher `/publisher/*`, dev port: 3001)
- [agentops-lite/](agentops-lite/) — Specialized agent monitoring and operations tool

### 2. Client Projects
- [PROJECTS/](PROJECTS/) — Client delivery artifacts and project-specific documentation

### 3. Agent Orchestration
- [orchestration/](orchestration/) — The "Control Plane" for autonomous agent loops, task management, and routing rules

### 4. Knowledge Base (Future Consolidation)
- [HERMES-BRAIN/](HERMES-BRAIN/) — Shared knowledge and SOPs
- [OS/](OS/) — Sector-specific operating system definitions
- [DATA/](DATA/) — Raw data and entity registries

### 5. Infrastructure & History
- [docs/](docs/) — Monorepo-level documentation
- [reports/](reports/) — System-wide audit and status reports
- [graphify-out/](graphify-out/) — Knowledge graph metadata
- [archive/](archive/) — Historical documents and retired project artifacts

